    {
      "type": "view",
      "title": "Bind, author, collect, emit",
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "slideFrame",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "slideHeading",
              "title": "Styles move through four steps: bind, author, collect, emit",
              "lede": "Collection is a side effect of rendering, so the CSS that ships matches the HTML that rendered."
            },
            {
              "type": "slidePipeline",
              "start": "theme",
              "end": "CSS",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "title": "Bind",
                  "body": "`createDistillery` fixes the prefix, tokens, and scope selector. No brand of its own."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Author",
                  "body": "`createStyleModule` records typed declarations once, at module load."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Collect",
                  "body": "Resolving a class name during render pulls in that handle."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Emit",
                  "body": "`renderStyles` writes a readable sheet or a compact payload."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "brand": "Distillate",
          "section": "How it works",
          "sectionNumber": "02",
          "logo": false,
          "tone": "page",
          "url": "https://elastic.github.io/distillate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "view",
      "title": "Tokens are typed paths",
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "slideFrame",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "slideHeading",
              "title": "Tokens are **typed paths**, not strings",
              "lede": "Interpolating a token records a dependency. `lightDark` folds into `light-dark()`, `cq` inlines with no custom property, and unread tokens are pruned."
            },
            {
              "type": "slideCode",
              "panels": [
                {
                  "file": "distillery.ts",
                  "language": "ts",
                  "lines": [
                    "const distillery = createDistillery({",
                    "  prefix: 'eui',",
                    "  themeScope: '.eui-view',",
                    "  theme: {",
                    "    colors: {",
                    "      ink: lightDark('#111', '#eee'),",
                    "    },",
                    "    gap: cq('8px', '2cqi'),",
                    "  },",
                    "});"
                  ],
                  "highlightLines": [
                    6,
                    8
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "file": "demo.ts",
                  "language": "ts",
                  "lines": [
                    "const demo = distillery.createStyleModule(",
                    "  'demo',",
                    "  ({ css, tokens }) => ({",
                    "    root: css`",
                    "      color: ${tokens.colors.ink};",
                    "      padding: ${tokens.gap};",
                    "    `,",
                    "  })",
                    ");"
                  ],
                  "highlightLines": [
                    5,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "brand": "Distillate",
          "section": "How it works",
          "sectionNumber": "02",
          "logo": false,
          "tone": "page",
          "url": "https://elastic.github.io/distillate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "view",
      "title": "A module returns handles",
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "slideFrame",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "slideHeading",
              "title": "A module returns **handles**, not class names",
              "lede": "The same handle emits `.callout-root` or `.a`, depending on the resolver."
            },
            {
              "type": "slideCode",
              "panels": [
                {
                  "file": "callout.ts — adapted from docs/concepts/authoring.md",
                  "language": "ts",
                  "lines": [
                    "const callout = distillery.createStyleModule('callout', ({ css, decls, tokens }) => ({",
                    "  root: css`",
                    "    color: ${tokens.colors.ink};",
                    "    &:hover { color: ${tokens.colors.accent}; }",
                    "    @media (min-width: 600px) { padding: 16px; }",
                    "  `,",
                    "  title: css`font-weight: 600;`,",
                    "  tone: variants(['calm', 'loud'] as const, (tone) => css`",
                    "    outline-color: ${tone === 'calm' ? tokens.colors.surface : tokens.colors.accent};",
                    "  `),",
                    "  hoverTitle: rule(",
                    "    (h) => `${h.root}:hover ${h.title}`,",
                    "    decls`color: ${tokens.colors.accent};`",
                    "  ),",
                    "}));"
                  ],
                  "highlightLines": [
                    4,
                    5,
                    8,
                    11
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "brand": "Distillate",
          "section": "How it works",
          "sectionNumber": "02",
          "logo": false,
          "tone": "page",
          "url": "https://elastic.github.io/distillate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "view",
      "title": "The render decides what ships",
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "slideFrame",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "slideHeading",
              "title": "The render decides what ships",
              "lede": "Resolving a class name collects it. Everything the render never reached is pruned from an artifact."
            },
            {
              "type": "slideList",
              "items": [
                {
                  "term": "use(module)",
                  "body": "Every non-variant entry on the module."
                },
                {
                  "term": "useHandles",
                  "body": "Those handles, plus any `rule` or `media` whose selector deps are **all** live."
                },
                {
                  "term": "variants",
                  "body": "Ship only when a render names one, such as `tone.loud`."
                },
                {
                  "term": "theme tokens",
                  "body": "Only the paths a collected declaration reads, or `useThemeVar`."
                },
                {
                  "term": "vars defaults",
                  "body": "Only the keys each handle actually reads."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "brand": "Distillate",
          "section": "How it works",
          "sectionNumber": "02",
          "logo": false,
          "tone": "page",
          "url": "https://elastic.github.io/distillate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "view",
      "title": "Two targets, two name modes",
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "slideFrame",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "slideHeading",
              "title": "Two targets and two name modes make four outputs",
              "lede": "The target decides **what** ships; the name mode decides how it’s spelled."
            },
            {
              "type": "slideTable",
              "columns": [
                "Target",
                "Readable names",
                "Compact names"
              ],
              "rowHeaders": true,
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Stylesheet",
                  "Full public sheet, e.g. .demo-root",
                  "Minified full sheet; rarely worth it"
                ],
                [
                  "Artifact",
                  "Only the handles a render reached",
                  "Minimal payload, e.g. .a and --b"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "slideSource",
              "text": "`stylesheetCollector()` preloads every module; `artifactCollector()` starts empty"
            }
          ],
          "brand": "Distillate",
          "section": "How it works",
          "sectionNumber": "02",
          "logo": false,
          "tone": "page",
          "url": "https://elastic.github.io/distillate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "view",
      "title": "Compact names take two passes",
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "slideFrame",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "slideHeading",
              "title": "Compact names take **two passes**",
              "lede": "Short names are assigned from the full collected set, so collect everything first, then resolve and print. Readable artifacts skip the second pass."
            },
            {
              "type": "slideCode",
              "panels": [
                {
                  "file": "docs/guides/compact-artifacts.md",
                  "language": "ts",
                  "lines": [
                    "const collector = distillery.artifactCollector('compact');",
                    "",
                    "// Pass 1: collect every handle the render wears. Don't read names yet.",
                    "const retained = collector.useHandles([panel.handles.root, panel.handles.tone.loud]);",
                    "",
                    "// Pass 2: names now depend on the whole set.",
                    "const resolver = collector.createResolver();",
                    "const className = retained.map((h) => resolver.className(h.key, h.readableName)).join(' ');",
                    "const css = distillery.renderStyles(collector, resolver);"
                  ],
                  "highlightLines": [
                    4,
                    7
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "brand": "Distillate",
          "section": "How it works",
          "sectionNumber": "02",
          "logo": false,
          "tone": "page",
          "url": "https://elastic.github.io/distillate"
        }
